@reactions repair
// Writer 4, batch 10. Reactions to the Works side's repairs: who notices are Works techs and the people who use the
// thing. .you by tier; @dept for "a repair in my department". Calder's are dry and rare; Torres's warm.

// ---- the scrubbers ----
? cue:repair.scrubber !cue:repair.scrubber.you
- Air tastes cleaner today. Someone did the scrubber.
- Scrubber's quiet. That's how you know it's right.
? cue:repair.scrubber.you tier>=friend
- You stripped a scrubber? Kovac will be proud. Well, quietly.   #warm
? cue:repair.scrubber.you@dept dept:works
- Scrubber off the board. Good work. Clean seals, I hear.
? cue:repair.scrubber.you who:calder
- Scrubber. Logged. Good.
? cue:repair.scrubber.you who:kovac-zainab
- Your scrubber. I looked. It's... yes. Good.   #warm

// ---- the fans ----
? cue:repair.fan !cue:repair.fan.you
- The fan's stopped rattling. Peace at last.   #funny
- Someone sorted the fan. I can hear myself think.
? cue:repair.fan.you tier>=acquaintance
- That fan was you? {thanks}. It sang at me for days.   #funny
? cue:repair.fan.you@dept dept:works
- Fan's balanced. Calder heard it from the office. That's a compliment.
? cue:repair.fan.you who:calder
- The fan on Deck 4. It sounds right now. Fair.
? cue:repair.fan.you who:torres-zeke
- Heard the fan purring. You did that. Properly. Right, onward!   #warm

// ---- the junctions ----
? cue:repair.junction !cue:repair.junction.you
- The power's steady again. Someone did the junction.
? cue:repair.junction.you tier>=acquaintance
- No more flicker on Deck 3. Was that you? Good.
? cue:repair.junction.you tier>=friend
- A junction! Look at you, doing the fiddly ones.   #warm
? cue:repair.junction.you@dept dept:works
- Junction's clean. Labels and all. Somebody taught you right.
? cue:repair.junction.you who:calder
- Junction box. Labelled. Logged. Good.
? cue:repair.junction.you dept:comms
- The relay stopped humming. Thank you. Clean signal.

// ---- the heat pumps ----
? cue:repair.heatpump !cue:repair.heatpump.you
- Warm again. The heat pump's back.
- Somebody fixed the heat pump. My toes are grateful.   #funny
? cue:repair.heatpump.you tier>=acquaintance
- Heat pump was you? {thanks}. I've taken off one jumper.   #funny
? cue:repair.heatpump.you@dept dept:works
- Heat pump's running sweet. Good job on that.
? cue:repair.heatpump.you who:torres-zeke
- You did the heat pump? On your own? I'm so pleased. Tea!   #warm
? cue:repair.heatpump.you rank:junior deck:4
- The bunks are warm again. That was you? Hero of Deck 4.   #funny

// ---- the air plant ----
? cue:repair.airplant !cue:repair.airplant.you
- The air plant's humming right. Breathe easy, everyone.
? cue:repair.airplant.you tier>=acquaintance
- That big air job was you? {thanks}. Nobody thanks the air. I will.   #warm
? cue:repair.airplant.you tier>=friend
- The air plant! That's a proper job. I'm impressed. Honestly.
? cue:repair.airplant.you@dept dept:works
- Air plant's off the board. Calder looked twice. That's a good sign.   #funny
? cue:repair.airplant.you who:calder
- The air plant. Nobody thanks the air. So: noted.
? cue:repair.airplant.you dept:infirmary
- Air's clean in here again. Thank you. The patients breathe easier.

// ---- the recyclers ----
? cue:repair.recycler !cue:repair.recycler.you
- The recycler's back. Water tastes like water again.
- Somebody fixed the recycler. Not glamorous. Very important.
? cue:repair.recycler.you tier>=acquaintance
- The recycler was you? {thanks}. Clean water. Big deal, that.
? cue:repair.recycler.you@dept dept:works
- Recycler job done. Messy one. Good on you.   #funny
? cue:repair.recycler.you dept:galley
- The water's sweet again. Tea tastes right. Thank you.   #warm
? cue:repair.recycler.you dept:garden
- Mm. Clean water. The beds can tell. Thank you.

// ---- the drive coils ----
? cue:repair.coil !cue:repair.coil.you
- All three coils in tune again, I hear.
? cue:repair.coil.you tier>=friend
- You on the coils! Down in the deep ship. Look at you.   #warm
? cue:repair.coil.you@dept dept:works
- Coil job off the board. Torres is telling everyone. Loudly.   #funny
? cue:repair.coil.you who:torres-zeke
- You helped coil three! She sulked less. Well. A bit less. Proud of you.   #warm
? cue:repair.coil.you who:reyes-alejandro
- Coil three's calm tonight. Your work? Thank you. She's not shy now.   #funny
? cue:repair.coil.you who:calder
- The coils. Torres says you were careful. Good.

// ---- the lift ----
? cue:repair.lift !cue:repair.lift.you
- Lift's running smooth. No more clunk at Deck 4.
- Somebody fixed the lift. Three people I know just breathed out.   #funny
? cue:repair.lift.you tier>=acquaintance
- The lift was you? {thanks}. Four, please. Smoothly.   #funny
? cue:repair.lift.you@dept dept:works
- Lift's off the board. Everyone on the ship noticed. Nice.
? cue:repair.lift.you who:kovac-zainab|cruz-tove|keane-davi
- The lift's better. Good. Not that I use it. Much.   #funny
? cue:repair.lift.you dept:galley
- Trays up and down again, on time. Thank you.
